  "job_B8.4.3.3_20251003_114855": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00feam men, A\u00feene \u00feine hand, & he A\u00feenode & his \u00dea wurdon hig mid unwisdome gefyllede & sp\u00e6con betux him hw\u00e6t hig \u00feam H\u00e6lende dydon. So\u00felice on \u00feam dagum he ferde on anne munt hine gebiddan, & w\u00e6s \u00fear waciende on Godes gebede. And \u00fea \u00f0a d\u00e6g w\u00e6s he clypode hys leorningcnihtas & geceas twelf of him, & \u00fea he nemde apostolas. Simonem \u00fe\u00e6ne he nemde Petrus & his bro\u00f0or Andreas, Iacobum & Iohannem, Filippum & And mid him farendum he stod on feldlice stowe, & mycel wered his leorningcnihta, & mycel & \u00fea \u00f0e w\u00e6ron of uncl\u00e6num gastum gedrehte w\u00e6run geh\u00e6lede. And eal seo menigeo sohte hine to \u00e6thrinenne, for\u00feam \u00fee m\u00e6gen of him eode & he ealle geh\u00e6lde. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00fe se h\u00e6lend beseonde to his leorningcnihtum, Eadige synd ge \u00feearfan on gaste for\u00feam \u00fee Eadige synd ge \u00f0e hingria\u00f0 nu, for\u00feam \u00fee ge beo\u00f0 gefyllede. Eadige synt ge \u00f0e nu wepa\u00f0, for\u00feam ge hliha\u00fe. Eadige beo ge, \u00feone eow men hatia\u00f0 & ehta\u00f0, & onhisca\u00fe, & awurpa\u00f0 eowerne naman swa swa yfel Geblissia\u00f0 & gefagnia\u00f0 on \u00feam dagum, nu eower med is mycel on heofenum; So\u00f0lice \u00e6fter \u00feissum \u00deeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere wa eow witegum, for\u00feam \u00fee ge eowerne frofor habba\u00f0. Wa eow \u00fee gefyllede synt, for\u00feam \u00fe",
